<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GraphMap" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Term Map is an Expression Map with optionally a term type specified.\n    " .
_:nc67090513f874e46a762bcde1be410f8b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A shortcut on an Expression Map: its value must be a\n        boolean-returning function-valued expression map. If the\n        condition evaluates to true, the enclosing Expression Map's own\n        value is used.\n        " .
_:Nc5c0ea74540443deb0069eaeb39316c8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
