_:n2f347bf5453c4b6d93e005168d011e31b7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Exactly one rml:inputValue or rml:inputValueMap is required.\n        " .
_:n2f347bf5453c4b6d93e005168d011e31b6 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Parameters to supply to FnO function.\n        " .
