_:ndff0190e57ed4b71930c7e02dee3485cb7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:child/rml:childMap may only be provided once and \n        not at the same time.\n        " .
_:nc029abccdb0e48d3b5e7721b715556a1b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:gatherAs specifies how to gather the collection e.g. a rdf:Alt,\n        rdf:List, rdf:Bag, or rdf:Seq.\n        " .
