_:n37cf3c50b2f94efc9c6fa59f7d1b66b7b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
_:ne11feece8fea411cb6198fbffe8a232db3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:n7c45205ebda4414c8fbf7c2df6a9f6f5b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:objectMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
